# StyLua formats to LF. Without this, files committed from Windows carry CRLF,
# `stylua --check` fails on every file on the Linux CI runner, and the diff is
# pure noise. `eol=lf` forces LF in the working tree too (overriding
# core.autocrlf), so local and CI agree. Rojo and Studio both read LF fine.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Roblox model files are binary - never line-ending convert or diff them.
*.rbxm binary
*.rbxl binary
*.rbxlx binary
